/-!
The six arrays transcribe the `GROUP_GENERATORS` block of the Nebe–Sloane
Catalogue of Lattices entry for P48m, in the published order and row convention.
The SHA-256 of the HTML is
`6eb739180d41ff375139a6a3031bdb2c2ea3626c547d758c14fbbc20940258e9`.
<https://www.math.rwth-aachen.de/~Gabriele.Nebe/LATTICES/P48m.html#GROUP_GENERATORS>

Every generator has a zero upper-right 32-by-16 block, so vectors supported
on the first 32 coordinates form an invariant rational row subspace.
The representation hypothesis identifies the catalogue generators in the
chosen basis. The conclusion is for their generated subgroup.
-/

